{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y的音乐感受描写明显不如X细腻，尤其缺少按具体乐句出现的细微情绪变化和音乐动作对应。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的左右分工比较清楚，左边完整讲述人物的心理和行为因果，右边提供辅助感受，普通观众更容易在听音乐时迅速理解故事，并把十三段连成一条完整的心理变化线。X的重点标记更醒目，音乐感受也更丰富、更具体，特别是到时出现的提示能把细腻变化贴合到音乐进程中；但感受信息较密，容易让观众把注意力分散在大量短词上。综合第一次观看时的理解效率和叙事连贯性，我选Y，但它确实牺牲了一部分X的音乐细节表现力。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "cf44d6f9-4029-4946-a024-d93d201fc5aa", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T162029555490Z", "elapsed_seconds": 44.11, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T16:21:13.669467+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "798b3dd6cc7af9626cbdfd5bbe8bdd4afeb5a7ec954426b8cc6fb752649bfa10", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gp